  "reviewer_note": "Treccani dates the death to the night of 13-14 September 1321; the Catholic Encyclopedia gives 14 September. Exact birth day unknown (May-June 1265). The Catholic Encyclopedia is a 1913 text. Treccani says Dante probably never returned to Florence after the 1301 embassy; the summary does not claim it.",
